### Medical Incapacity Notification (MED.A.020)
Pilots must not exercise licence privileges and must notify their AME when:
* Hospital/clinic admission **> 12 hours**;
* Surgical operation or invasive procedure;
* Regular use of any medication;
* Pregnancy (at confirmation);
* Any significant personal injury or illness causing **inability to act as pilot for > 21 days**.

